# Play a C-major scale, then silence (0 Hz).
device audio
audio tone 262hz
delay 300ms
audio tone 294hz
delay 300ms
audio tone 330hz
delay 300ms
audio tone 349hz
delay 300ms
audio tone 392hz
delay 300ms
audio tone 440hz
delay 300ms
audio tone 494hz
delay 300ms
audio tone 523hz
delay 300ms
audio tone 0hz
